1
00:00:15,348 --> 00:00:18,518
Tae Oh... five more minutes...

2
00:00:42,742 --> 00:00:44,411
Holy shit...

3
00:00:49,816 --> 00:00:51,985
Just stay still

4
00:00:53,686 --> 00:00:56,189
Can you do something about this?

5
00:00:56,189 --> 00:00:59,192
Do something about what? It's morning

6
00:00:59,192 --> 00:01:01,361
You have one too, you should know

7
00:01:01,361 --> 00:01:03,763
It just means I'm healthy

8
00:01:03,763 --> 00:01:06,566
You psycho, get away from me...

9
00:01:14,140 --> 00:01:15,742
Rude...

10
00:01:15,742 --> 00:01:19,079
You kept clinging to me all night
saying you were cold

11
00:01:19,079 --> 00:01:22,482
I was nice enough to be your human body pillow

12
00:01:22,482 --> 00:01:24,651
and this is the thanks I get?

13
00:01:24,651 --> 00:01:27,187
Whatever...

14
00:01:35,195 --> 00:01:37,564
How's he so confident?

15
00:01:50,343 --> 00:01:52,679
Do you usually cook for yourself?

16
00:01:52,679 --> 00:01:54,447
Ever since that bastard Tae Oh scammed me,

17
00:01:54,447 --> 00:01:56,449
I can't afford takeout anymore

18
00:01:56,850 --> 00:01:59,252
It's been a while
since I've had a home-cooked meal

19
00:02:00,620 --> 00:02:04,224
Tae Oh never cooked for me even once

20
00:02:04,224 --> 00:02:06,292
You think that bastard would ever lift a finger?

21
00:02:06,292 --> 00:02:09,129
The only thing he's good at is talking
and living off other people

22
00:02:09,129 --> 00:02:12,599
And you spent three years
cooking for a guy like that

23
00:02:14,100 --> 00:02:15,268
Hey, don't sweat it

24
00:02:15,268 --> 00:02:16,703
Don't let it get to you

25
00:02:16,703 --> 00:02:18,271
From now on,

26
00:02:18,271 --> 00:02:20,740
we're getting every penny of that back from his life

27
00:02:27,514 --> 00:02:29,315
Oh, and I've gotta head out for a bit today

28
00:02:29,849 --> 00:02:31,351
Where?

29
00:02:31,351 --> 00:02:35,221
I found another person Tae Oh scammed
with his investment scheme

30
00:02:35,221 --> 00:02:37,790
Need to collect some evidence from them

31
00:02:53,873 --> 00:02:55,508
Figure out lunch on your own

32
00:02:55,542 --> 00:02:57,810
I'll be back soon, so stay home

33
00:02:57,810 --> 00:02:59,679
Call me if anything happens

34
00:02:59,679 --> 00:03:00,847
Okay

35
00:03:00,847 --> 00:03:02,315
See you later

36
00:03:24,003 --> 00:03:30,476
[Tae Oh]

37
00:03:33,947 --> 00:03:35,615
Why are you calling?

38
00:03:35,615 --> 00:03:37,584
Heesu, why haven't you been answering me lately?

39
00:03:37,584 --> 00:03:39,586
Where have you been?

40
00:03:39,586 --> 00:03:41,588
Why haven't I been answering?

41
00:03:42,055 --> 00:03:43,323
You seriously have to ask?

42
00:03:43,323 --> 00:03:45,625
Heesu, you're all I have...

43
00:03:45,625 --> 00:03:48,194
The marriage... I really didn't have a choice

44
00:03:48,194 --> 00:03:49,629
You can understand that, right?

45
00:03:49,629 --> 00:03:51,464
What about my money?

46
00:03:51,464 --> 00:03:55,568
I told you I'd pay it back as soon as I can

47
00:03:55,735 --> 00:03:57,770
And when exactly is that?

48
00:03:57,770 --> 00:04:00,240
I'm sorry, Heesu. You're really all I have

49
00:04:06,045 --> 00:04:07,814
Fucking psycho...

50
00:04:20,960 --> 00:04:22,328
Sorry I'm late

51
00:04:22,328 --> 00:04:24,797
The meeting ran longer than I expected...

52
00:04:32,472 --> 00:04:34,807
Something wrong?

53
00:04:37,243 --> 00:04:39,646
What happened?

54
00:04:41,281 --> 00:04:43,249
He called...

55
00:04:44,617 --> 00:04:46,619
Tae Oh

56
00:04:49,122 --> 00:04:50,923
Did you pick up?

57
00:04:54,394 --> 00:04:56,963
What did that bastard say?

58
00:04:57,430 --> 00:04:59,432
He said he's sorry...

59
00:04:59,866 --> 00:05:00,866
What?

60
00:05:01,267 --> 00:05:04,003
That I'm all he has...

61
00:05:05,038 --> 00:05:08,308
That he had no choice but to get married...

62
00:05:08,808 --> 00:05:10,109
Don't fall for that crap

63
00:05:10,109 --> 00:05:12,245
He's just trying to keep you quiet

64
00:05:12,245 --> 00:05:15,415
Do you really think Tae Oh loves you?

65
00:05:16,015 --> 00:05:18,251
I know he doesn't

66
00:05:20,453 --> 00:05:22,288
But...

67
00:05:23,056 --> 00:05:25,058
This hurts so much

68
00:05:26,125 --> 00:05:31,364
I took a leave from school for of him...

69
00:05:34,801 --> 00:05:37,437
Just to help pay off his debts

70
00:05:39,072 --> 00:05:41,841
I worked day and night without a break...

71
00:05:44,577 --> 00:05:46,379
Even so...

72
00:05:47,213 --> 00:05:49,849
I did all of it because I loved him...

73
00:05:52,251 --> 00:05:55,154
That's what made it all worth it...

74
00:05:56,422 --> 00:05:59,025
He shouldn't have done this to me

75
00:06:00,226 --> 00:06:03,363
I... had nobody but him

76
00:06:06,065 --> 00:06:08,968
He was all I ever looked at...

77
00:06:13,940 --> 00:06:16,008
Look at me

78
00:06:18,978 --> 00:06:21,781
Do you want to stop thinking about Tae Oh?

79
00:06:24,183 --> 00:06:25,183
Yeah...

80
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:57,700
"My Ex's Wedding"
